  "action": "call_sister",
  "words": "It’s Phil. I’m in Pittsburgh right now, just stepped off the coach. I need you to confirm the van driver is definitely there at 8 AM tomorrow for the couch. Don't just say yes; make sure he knows the address and the time. I’ll be ready.",
  "intention": "To lock in the specific logistics for the couch move while I am physically present in the city, ensuring the task is secured before the day resets.",
  "detail": "I dial the number I memorized from last Tuesday. The line rings three times. I keep my voice steady, professional, and direct. I do not mention the time loop, the hotel, or the radio. I am a man who has arrived to do a job, and I am confirming the details of that job. When she confirms, I hang up. I will not wait at the ballroom for a crew that isn't mine. I will not sleep on a bench. I will go to the hotel, check out or check in, and ensure I am rested for the 8 AM pickup. The loop is my enemy, but the couch is my anchor. If I miss this, I lose."
